WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:15.310
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.310 --> 00:18.650
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.650 --> 00:21.950
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:27.390
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo
manzoku suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.590 --> 00:34.530
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro
no sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:36.600
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.600 --> 00:41.840
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka
ni kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.840 --> 00:44.870
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.870 --> 00:48.140
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:51.750
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.750 --> 00:55.410
<b>lma sugu ni</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.000
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:13.240
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no
naka jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.240 --> 01:16.340
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.340 --> 01:19.570
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.570 --> 01:23.150
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.150 --> 01:25.810
<b>lma sugu ni</b>

01:43.100 --> 01:45.400
<b>This is a dead end as well.</b>

01:45.400 --> 01:48.740
<b>Damn! What the hell is
up with this forest?!</b>

01:48.740 --> 01:50.400
<b>Just when are we going to get out?!</b>

01:50.970 --> 01:52.470
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

01:52.470 --> 01:54.030
<b>Is that all you can say?!</b>

01:57.180 --> 02:00.880
<b>We should've been able to make
it out in just an hour or two.</b>

02:00.880 --> 02:03.080
<b>Just be honest and say you're lost.</b>

02:05.190 --> 02:06.860
<b>I'm hungry!</b>

02:06.860 --> 02:10.290
<b>With this fog, we'd better
not wander around aimlessly.</b>

02:10.290 --> 02:13.300
<b>What are we going to do
if the fog doesn't clear?!</b>

02:13.300 --> 02:16.970
<b>Don't ask questions you already
know the answers to. We rough it.</b>

02:16.970 --> 02:18.430
<b>Rough it?!</b>

02:21.100 --> 02:22.570
<b>Where are you going, Gojyo?</b>

02:23.570 --> 02:26.910
<b>I have a rule about always
spending the night near women.</b>

02:26.910 --> 02:28.680
<b>I'm going to go look for a way out.</b>

02:28.680 --> 02:30.140
<b>Me too!</b>

02:34.020 --> 02:35.480
<b>Wait up, Gojyo!</b>

02:36.120 --> 02:37.490
<b>Sanzo...</b>

02:37.490 --> 02:37.620
<b>Let them do what they want.
Sanzo...</b>

02:37.620 --> 02:38.950
<b>Let them do what they want.</b>

02:56.170 --> 02:59.330
<b>I was sure I smelled
some food over here.</b>

03:07.450 --> 03:12.080
<b>We're looking for an exit! Forget
about food until the next town!</b>

03:13.050 --> 03:15.450
<b>I can't move around on
an empty stomach!</b>

03:17.190 --> 03:18.660
<b>He's such a brat.</b>

03:51.630 --> 03:53.090
<b>Flowers...</b>

03:54.100 --> 03:57.070
<b>Mom! Mom, look. Here.</b>

03:57.070 --> 03:59.570
<b>The man at the flower shop
said these were for you.</b>

03:59.570 --> 04:01.070
<b>My, really?</b>

04:01.070 --> 04:02.570
<b>What a beautiful</b>

04:02.570 --> 04:04.040
<b>bloody color!</b>

04:08.210 --> 04:11.010
<b>Stop! That hurts! Mom!</b>

04:11.010 --> 04:12.710
<b>How disgustingly ugly!</b>

04:12.710 --> 04:16.320
<b>Ugly, just like the blood
of that woman!</b>

04:16.320 --> 04:17.790
<b>Mom?!</b>

04:19.850 --> 04:21.290
<b>Stop it, Mom!</b>

04:21.960 --> 04:23.420
<b>Oh, Jien!</b>

04:25.060 --> 04:27.030
<b>Gojyo, go back to your room.</b>

04:28.030 --> 04:31.490
<b>You're the only one
Mother loves, Jien.</b>

04:36.070 --> 04:38.370
<b>It sure dredged up some
unpleasant memories.</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:47.810
<b>Man, just my luck.</b>

05:03.700 --> 05:05.170
<b>A breeze?</b>

05:08.040 --> 05:09.870
<b>Does this lead somewhere?</b>

05:18.110 --> 05:19.880
<b>An old tunnel?</b>

05:20.750 --> 05:22.520
<b>Goku!</b>

05:22.520 --> 05:25.650
<b>Stupid monkey with a stomach
for a brain! Answer me!</b>

05:29.060 --> 05:30.520
<b>Can't hear me?</b>

05:50.950 --> 05:52.610
<b>Left or right?</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:56.980
<b>Heads, right; tails, left.</b>

06:05.060 --> 06:06.530
<b>Tails?</b>

06:09.060 --> 06:13.000
<b>You're my marker, all right? So, you
better not get taken by anyone.</b>

06:38.130 --> 06:39.890
<b>Again?</b>

06:39.890 --> 06:44.560
<b>I thought it was a good idea, but
I'm going to go broke at this rate.</b>

06:49.040 --> 06:52.100
<b>I got tails the first time, and...</b>

06:54.580 --> 06:56.240
<b>What the heck's going on?</b>

07:02.620 --> 07:05.350
<b>Hey! What are you doing, going
out in a place like this?!</b>

07:05.350 --> 07:06.790
<b>You gutless bastard!</b>

07:08.960 --> 07:10.420
<b>Oh, damn you!</b>

07:14.160 --> 07:17.190
<b>Now, what to do?</b>

07:35.220 --> 07:36.980
<b>Gojyo?! Is that you, Gojyo?!</b>

07:38.350 --> 07:39.840
<b>Dokugaku!</b>

07:42.820 --> 07:45.660
<b>He's taking so long. What do
you suppose happened?</b>

07:47.860 --> 07:50.900
<b>He's probably sitting out
the rain somewhere.</b>

07:50.900 --> 07:52.700
<b>No need to worry.</b>

07:52.700 --> 07:54.170
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

07:58.170 --> 08:01.440
<b>But something about
this forest bothers me.</b>

08:01.440 --> 08:03.770
<b>First that fog and now this rain.</b>

08:05.950 --> 08:07.980
<b>Lord Kougaiji?</b>

08:07.980 --> 08:10.040
<b>Oh, no, it's nothing.</b>

08:10.690 --> 08:13.950
<b>Ever the worrier, Brother.</b>

08:14.720 --> 08:16.190
<b>I am not!</b>

08:18.560 --> 08:20.460
<b>I hope my concerns turn
out to be groundless.</b>

08:24.100 --> 08:28.040
<b>I never expected you guys to be
lost in the same forest as us.</b>

08:28.040 --> 08:30.370
<b>That's my line.</b>

08:30.370 --> 08:31.870
<b>If it weren't for the current situation,</b>

08:31.870 --> 08:33.970
<b>I'd report to Kougaiji
right away and...</b>

08:36.310 --> 08:37.780
<b>What's wrong?</b>

08:39.010 --> 08:41.650
<b>That's the mark I made earlier.</b>

08:41.650 --> 08:44.890
<b>No doubt about it then.</b>

08:44.890 --> 08:47.420
<b>There's a barrier set in this place.</b>

08:47.420 --> 08:49.190
<b>So, we can't get out?</b>

08:49.960 --> 08:52.560
<b>You sure you guys
didn't set this up?</b>

08:52.560 --> 08:57.100
<b>If we had, it wouldn't be just
the two of us together.</b>

08:57.100 --> 08:58.430
<b>What did you say?!</b>

08:58.430 --> 08:58.600
<b>Man, and I thought I was lucky when
I found some change on the ground.
What did you say?!</b>

08:58.600 --> 09:02.840
<b>Man, and I thought I was lucky when
I found some change on the ground.</b>

09:02.840 --> 09:04.410
<b>That's mine!</b>

09:04.410 --> 09:05.940
<b>You got proof of that?</b>

09:05.940 --> 09:09.310
<b>I left them to mark my path! How
dare you just pick them up?!</b>

09:09.310 --> 09:10.610
<b>Not my problem!</b>

09:10.610 --> 09:10.810
<b>Give them back, you bastard!
Not my problem!</b>

09:10.810 --> 09:12.680
<b>Give them back, you bastard!</b>

09:15.380 --> 09:16.350
<b>Give them back!</b>

09:16.350 --> 09:16.880
<b>You'll only waste it if I give it to you,
Give them back!</b>

09:16.880 --> 09:19.020
<b>You'll only waste it if I give it to you,</b>

09:19.020 --> 09:20.660
<b>so I'll hang onto it for you.</b>

09:20.660 --> 09:23.660
<b>You say that, but you're just going
to spend it yourself, aren't you?!</b>

09:23.660 --> 09:25.130
<b>Oh, give it back!</b>

09:25.760 --> 09:27.230
<b>Wait!</b>

09:30.970 --> 09:33.330
<b>I guess you're not at an age for
lectures on wasting money anymore.</b>

09:37.110 --> 09:40.340
<b>If you're going to give them back
to me, give them back properly!</b>

09:40.340 --> 09:42.940
<b>Damn it, there should be one more.</b>

09:43.710 --> 09:45.510
<b>Hey, you're not very thoughtful!</b>

09:47.450 --> 09:50.040
<b>Damn it, where'd it go?</b>

09:51.790 --> 09:53.250
<b>Say, Gojyo?</b>

09:54.620 --> 09:57.920
<b>If all this fighting finally comes
to a conclusion...</b>

09:58.890 --> 10:00.560
<b>What the heck is this?</b>

10:00.560 --> 10:02.030
<b>What's the matter?</b>

10:04.370 --> 10:05.470
<b>A talisman?</b>

10:05.470 --> 10:05.830
<b>This is what the barrier's made of.
A talisman?</b>

10:05.830 --> 10:08.340
<b>This is what the barrier's made of.</b>

10:08.340 --> 10:09.800
<b>Damn troublemaker.</b>

10:12.140 --> 10:13.610
<b>Don't, Gojyo!</b>

10:18.480 --> 10:21.740
<b>Fool, to think you hastened
your own time of death.</b>

10:23.150 --> 10:24.650
<b>Who the hell are you?!</b>

10:24.650 --> 10:28.690
<b>My name is Yousui, the one who
will lead you to the world beyond.</b>

10:28.690 --> 10:30.390
<b>One of Homura's underlings?!</b>

10:30.390 --> 10:34.430
<b>To you, that's what I'd be.</b>

10:34.430 --> 10:35.930
<b>Come out!</b>

10:35.930 --> 10:37.430
<b>What idiot would actually come out</b>

10:37.430 --> 10:39.870
<b>when I could defeat you without
going to the trouble myself?</b>

10:42.200 --> 10:44.170
<b>Now, have you said your prayers?</b>

11:13.430 --> 11:16.300
<b>Here I thought the rain had let up,
but now we have fog again.</b>

11:17.670 --> 11:20.740
<b>It seems someone doesn't want
to let us out of the forest</b>

11:20.740 --> 11:22.240
<b>no matter what.</b>

11:22.240 --> 11:24.070
<b>Then, this rain and fog are...</b>

11:26.710 --> 11:31.150
<b>Who cares? We've got plenty of food.</b>

11:31.150 --> 11:33.920
<b>Use your brain for other
things a little too!</b>

11:33.920 --> 11:35.890
<b>That hurt! Don't hit me!</b>

11:36.490 --> 11:38.980
<b>Do you suppose Gojyo's all right?</b>

11:39.560 --> 11:43.560
<b>Who knows? About all
we can do right now</b>

11:43.560 --> 11:48.630
<b>is save our energy just in
case something does happen.</b>

12:07.120 --> 12:08.960
<b>Owowowow...</b>

12:08.960 --> 12:13.290
<b>Doesn't the ceiling usually
collapse in that situation?</b>

12:14.060 --> 12:17.830
<b>He probably didn't think
we'd croak so easily.</b>

12:17.830 --> 12:20.860
<b>I'm overjoyed to be held
in such high esteem.</b>

12:21.970 --> 12:25.570
<b>Besides, you're way too careless!</b>

12:25.570 --> 12:28.440
<b>That talisman was just
ASKING to be peeled off!</b>

12:28.440 --> 12:30.450
<b>Of course it's a trap!</b>

12:30.450 --> 12:33.310
<b>I'm just the sort of guy
who likes to strip things,</b>

12:33.310 --> 12:35.820
<b>whether they be talismans or women.</b>

12:35.820 --> 12:38.250
<b>Sheesh, you're such a brat.</b>

12:38.250 --> 12:40.660
<b>We were all brats once.</b>

12:40.660 --> 12:42.120
<b>Smartass.</b>

12:42.990 --> 12:44.960
<b>You're hurt?</b>

12:44.960 --> 12:46.430
<b>It's nothing serious.</b>

12:56.170 --> 12:59.970
<b>It used to be my job
to wrap the bandage.</b>

13:03.410 --> 13:07.250
<b>There was this brat who was always
tagging along and getting hurt.</b>

13:07.980 --> 13:10.210
<b>You got the wrong guy.
I've got no such memories.</b>

13:10.950 --> 13:13.250
<b>He still seems to always
have fresh wounds.</b>

13:14.620 --> 13:20.730
<b>I get it! You wear a bandana now to
use as a bandage in an emergency.</b>

13:20.730 --> 13:22.200
<b>Whatever.</b>

13:26.800 --> 13:29.940
<b>Hey, now, this is a pretty
classic maneuver.</b>

13:29.940 --> 13:32.270
<b>But its effects have
been proven long ago.</b>

13:33.040 --> 13:34.530
<b>Against normal people, maybe.</b>

13:37.580 --> 13:40.140
<b>Damn, it's pretty sturdy.</b>

13:40.880 --> 13:43.920
<b>Knock all you want, no one's
going to open a door for you!</b>

13:43.920 --> 13:48.860
<b>Shh! Any artificially made
thing has a weakness somewhere.</b>

13:48.860 --> 13:50.830
<b>You can find it by doing that?</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:52.490
<b>You just be quiet!</b>

13:53.490 --> 13:54.960
<b>Damn your big brother act.</b>

13:58.430 --> 14:01.700
<b>I don't really care,
but can you hurry up?</b>

14:01.700 --> 14:03.800
<b>It's getting kinda cramped in here.</b>

14:05.710 --> 14:07.340
<b>This is the spot.</b>

14:07.340 --> 14:08.810
<b>About time!</b>

14:22.290 --> 14:23.950
<b>Tenacious, as expected.</b>

14:26.990 --> 14:30.230
<b>But don't think you can
escape from this place.</b>

14:38.670 --> 14:40.040
<b>A corridor.</b>

14:40.040 --> 14:40.170
<b>It's really different compared
to the earlier tunnel.
A corridor.</b>

14:40.170 --> 14:42.610
<b>It's really different compared
to the earlier tunnel.</b>

14:44.810 --> 14:46.510
<b>Is this floor sloped?</b>

15:05.630 --> 15:07.400
<b>The inundation tactic now?</b>

15:07.400 --> 15:10.370
<b>We sure aren't being
taken very seriously.</b>

15:11.110 --> 15:14.170
<b>I won't let you think this is just
an ordinary inundation tactic.</b>

15:27.460 --> 15:28.920
<b>Dokugakuji!</b>

15:32.530 --> 15:35.230
<b>My secret art, the spell
of water beasts!</b>

15:35.230 --> 15:40.290
<b>Be killed by the water beasts
or drown, it's your choice.</b>

15:45.840 --> 15:48.040
<b>You okay, Gojyo?!</b>

15:49.110 --> 15:50.580
<b>Here they come!</b>

15:58.190 --> 15:59.950
<b>Gojyo, what are you...</b>

15:59.950 --> 16:01.620
<b>You have to ask?</b>

16:02.390 --> 16:05.550
<b>Our two groups have
always been enemies.</b>

16:07.230 --> 16:08.860
<b>I thought I might as
well settle this now,</b>

16:08.860 --> 16:12.160
<b>if we're not going to live anyway.</b>

16:13.170 --> 16:14.840
<b>Bastard...</b>

16:14.840 --> 16:18.790
<b>Interesting. So, you intend
to save me the trouble?</b>

16:21.480 --> 16:23.200
<b>Here goes, Jien.</b>

16:30.180 --> 16:31.650
<b>Gojyo!</b>

16:41.830 --> 16:42.730
<b>Gojyo!</b>

16:42.730 --> 16:43.330
<b>Looks like it's settled.
Gojyo!</b>

16:43.330 --> 16:44.470
<b>Looks like it's settled.</b>

16:44.470 --> 16:45.930
<b>Now, it's your turn!</b>

17:10.620 --> 17:12.650
<b>Let's see how long
your breath will last.</b>

17:19.700 --> 17:20.530
<b>What?!</b>

17:20.530 --> 17:21.170
<b>Hello, there.
What?!</b>

17:21.170 --> 17:22.270
<b>Hello, there.</b>

17:22.270 --> 17:24.610
<b>It's just like Jien said.</b>

17:24.610 --> 17:27.580
<b>I knocked around and found an exit.</b>

17:27.580 --> 17:30.370
<b>You were killed by the other man.</b>

17:31.280 --> 17:34.180
<b>Really? I guess something
like that did happen.</b>

17:34.180 --> 17:36.120
<b>A monkey show!</b>

17:36.120 --> 17:38.810
<b>I left the monkey back in the forest!</b>

17:40.720 --> 17:42.150
<b>Water beasts!</b>

17:45.990 --> 17:47.460
<b>Too slow!</b>

17:53.730 --> 17:57.730
<b>But the other man should've
run out of breath long ago.</b>

17:58.470 --> 18:00.740
<b>I can face Lord Homura without shame.</b>

18:05.080 --> 18:06.550
<b>Jien!</b>

18:32.710 --> 18:34.170
<b>Jien!</b>

18:55.000 --> 18:58.500
<b>I've always had the worst
luck with red flowers.</b>

18:58.500 --> 19:00.520
<b>Nothing good ever happens.</b>

19:01.440 --> 19:04.270
<b>But I actually rather like red flowers.</b>

19:06.240 --> 19:07.710
<b>Eccentric bastard.</b>

19:09.210 --> 19:11.150
<b>Gojyo!</b>

19:11.150 --> 19:13.580
<b>Hey, red roach water sprite!</b>

19:15.620 --> 19:17.080
<b>Looks like your ride's here.</b>

19:17.820 --> 19:19.810
<b>Took you long enough!</b>

19:22.520 --> 19:27.090
<b>I'll withdraw for today. We'll
settle this some other day.</b>

19:38.570 --> 19:41.130
<b>Come to think of it, I lost a coin.</b>

19:42.210 --> 19:44.640
<b>Guess I'll swipe one off the stupid
monkey one of these days.</b>

19:46.280 --> 19:47.750
<b>Dokugakuji!</b>

19:52.950 --> 19:57.250
<b>Where were you?! I got tired
of waiting, and I'm starving!</b>

19:57.960 --> 20:00.460
<b>Did something happen?</b>

20:00.460 --> 20:01.930
<b>Got rained on,</b>

20:03.830 --> 20:06.860
<b>and just reminisced a
little about the past.</b>

20:13.440 --> 20:15.940
<b>Oh, the exit was right there.</b>

20:15.940 --> 20:17.910
<b>I wonder why it took
so long to find it?</b>

20:18.480 --> 20:20.050
<b>That's because...</b>

20:20.050 --> 20:23.120
<b>You were doing a bad job searching.</b>

20:23.120 --> 20:25.450
<b>Gojyo, you were looking too!</b>

20:25.450 --> 20:29.920
<b>All you were thinking about
was food, you stomach monkey!</b>

20:29.920 --> 20:32.130
<b>Then don't eat that!</b>

20:32.130 --> 20:33.590
<b>Shut up!</b>

20:45.540 --> 20:54.350
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:55.720 --> 21:06.120
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no
naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:07.460 --> 21:17.600
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:18.940 --> 21:31.920
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:31.920 --> 21:43.360
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:43.360 --> 21:54.640
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:54.640 --> 22:06.820
<b>lma nara kitto aruite
yukeru doko made mo</b>
